<section id="christmas-play-guides" class="content-section game-guide christmas-guides" aria-labelledby="christmas-play-guides-heading">
  <span class="eyebrow">A DIFFERENT WAY TO PLAY</span>
  <h2 id="christmas-play-guides-heading">Find Your Christmas Challenge</h2>
  <p>Pick the decision you want to practice, from keeping Santa clear of hazards to remembering where a matching card belongs.</p>
  <div class="challenge-grid">
    <section>
      <h3>Catch and fly</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/santa-collecting-gifts/#gift-or-bomb">Santa Collecting Gifts: read the falling objects</a><p>Compare presents, bombs, and the lives display before choosing where to move.</p></li>
        <li><a href="/crazy-christmas-fun/#balloon-route">Crazy Christmas Fun: find room for the sleigh</a><p>Watch the space ahead of the lead reindeer and use the hearts as feedback.</p></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>Build and break</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/merge-christmas/#plan-your-drop">Merge Christmas: plan the landing space</a><p>Think through the next drop and the arrangement it leaves behind.</p></li>
        <li><a href="/xmas-balls/#plan-your-shot">Xmas Balls: choose a useful shot</a><p>Weigh the lowest gift blocks against a chance to collect more balls.</p></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>Match and remember</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/xmas-triple-mahjong/#open-corners">Xmas Triple Mahjong: uncover the layer beneath three trees</a><p>Compare the board before and after a tree triple reveals two stars and an owl.</p></li>
        <li><a href="/xmas-memory-match/#remember-the-grid">Xmas Memory Match: remember a card’s address</a><p>Use rows and columns to turn a revealed picture into your next match.</p></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>Observe and react</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/scroll-and-spot/#compare-scenes">Scroll and Spot: compare one landmark at a time</a><p>Follow the same part of both scenes as you work through the picture.</p></li>
        <li><a href="/subway-santa-runner-christmas/#runner-controls">Subway Santa Runner Christmas: learn the running actions</a><p>Check the player’s controls before working on a longer attempt.</p></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>

